  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="5" corresp="#wit-q">Dominus Iesus Christus dixit: 'In quo iudicio iudicaueritis, iudicabimini '</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="5" corresp="#wit-g-a">Drihten cwæð: ‘Be ðam ylcan dome, ðe ge nú mannum demað, eow byð eft gedemed’.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#unattributed" corresp="#wit-g-a">The Lord said: “By the same judgement that you now judge a man, so you will hereafter be judged.”</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Der Herr sprach: ‘Nach demselben Urtheilsspruche, den ihr jetzt Menschen ertheilet, wird später euch zuerkannt werden’.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">The Lord said: ‘By the same judgment that you now pass on men, judgment will later be passed on you’.</ab>
        <note type="passageSource">Matthew 7:2</note>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="474">Matth. 7, 2</note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">Matth. 7, 2</note>
      </div>
    </body>
